        维护一张以递归 Data RunGraph 为执行模型的跨仓 DAG；根据真实 authority 缺口切分 bounded Track，禁止重新引入 GoalGraph、动态 catalog 第二真源或 VM Holon 兼容退路。
        </?01M18K29XAV7TAFC74ZTQMVW08>
      )>
      <Actor { role = "MissionObserver" project_ref = "eidolon-anchor" } (
        <Description ?01M18K29XBYJ4SQWRRAJKFANP5>
        读取 depa-flows SubFlow/AI Data checkpoint、Halfcode resource authoring/effective registry、Eidolon Agent/Conversation 与 TaskSpace/Holon actor事实、四项目 dirty state、当前 HEAD tests和 Track lifecycle；严格区分 Definition authoring、definition selection、instance creation与targeting。
        </?01M18K29XBYJ4SQWRRAJKFANP5>
      )>
      <Actor { role = "MissionReconciler" project_ref = "eidolon-anchor" } (
        <Description ?01M18K29XBYJ4SQWRRAJKFANP6>
        逐项比较唯一 graph authority、动态资源 receipt/freeze、canonical pump parity、旧路径静态清零和 Ctrl/Data 产品 E2E；发现 API/authority 漂移时写 replan evidence并保持原成功判据，不用较小替代方案伪装收敛。
        </?01M18K29XBYJ4SQWRRAJKFANP6>
      )>
      <Actor { role = "MissionApplier" project_ref = "eidolon-anchor" } (
        <Description ?01M18K29XBYJ4SQWRRAJKFANP7>
        在真正 owner项目创建、绑定、实现、验证和归档 Track；通过 apply_patch保留现有 dirty hunks，并在重叠前使用 .tmp/chat.jsonl 协商；每个 operation以当前源码、fresh test、resource/checkpoint/TaskSpace receipt收口。
        </?01M18K29XBYJ4SQWRRAJKFANP7>
      )>
    ]>
  ]>
  <TaskSpace #space_build-recursive-ai-data-mission-control-and-canonical-holon-runtime { name = "build-recursive-ai-data-mission-control-and-canonical-holon-runtime" version = "1" child_mode = "dag" } (
    <Description ?01M18K29XBYJ4SQWRRAJKFANP8>
